  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "一陣人組成ê樂團"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>A-ian</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEheypRPYn1rEqf52m3gGjqh0dnl4X8elT8sFQs_OauNdplmqIBbSGdZhPuA-FhB4D_xjN9ELzetWWTveU5JsR0laed2JLEODZorGvQTm4RnQgTZUyN9Te7-jdAisEPICfLHRENCTCB9FGC1bXgJ3i-G9Kw6U39wqssFHlgr5gscvu-Z9oja0U3mS2r7ag/s2048/329595952_731305185043999_6779070430722723103_n.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1520\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"476\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEheypRPYn1rEqf52m3gGjqh0dnl4X8elT8sFQs_OauNdplmqIBbSGdZhPuA-FhB4D_xjN9ELzetWWTveU5JsR0laed2JLEODZorGvQTm4RnQgTZUyN9Te7-jdAisEPICfLHRENCTCB9FGC1bXgJ3i-G9Kw6U39wqssFHlgr5gscvu-Z9oja0U3mS2r7ag/w640-h476/329595952_731305185043999_6779070430722723103_n.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj9Rzwxqu8odkg71Tph0mWBnnsmZJyMMrDoo4dcr52gOhJ2AmpzJ9Ptqkb6IjgCZyaiu0dfYt2tGWsUb49s209ifhu6Cf9KSlub_azsVNJkNZhIoU3yOvwfwDXNymEBigtxG6ZJNavKOvd2-P5ak-xswtkhoUYu43SL5iX_Vs5FEtHpwMTFD01Nr2I0kg/s2048/329964741_985108922468622_920407096084383528_n.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1096\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"342\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj9Rzwxqu8odkg71Tph0mWBnnsmZJyMMrDoo4dcr52gOhJ2AmpzJ9Ptqkb6IjgCZyaiu0dfYt2tGWsUb49s209ifhu6Cf9KSlub_azsVNJkNZhIoU3yOvwfwDXNymEBigtxG6ZJNavKOvd2-P5ak-xswtkhoUYu43SL5iX_Vs5FEtHpwMTFD01Nr2I0kg/w640-h342/329964741_985108922468622_920407096084383528_n.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一般流行樂團ê組成，定著是四五个仔音樂人，一人負責一項樂器，逐家鬥陣做音樂，mā鬥陣tī台仔頂表演。樂團--裡tsit幾个音樂專業ê人，除了ài負責音樂ê事工，定著mā ài兼leh負責其他ê團務，包括處理行政流程、規畫計畫、宣傳、寫文案、對外溝通等。M̄-koh tsia-ê穡頭，suah拄好是濟濟音樂人無內行--ê，致使kài濟樂團，雖然tī音樂上有真好ê表現，尾手suah因為kap音樂無tī代ê原因來煞鼓。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語路親子樂團kap傳統ê樂團無仝，是由「一陣」有仝款理念ê人所組成--ê。其中除了有幾若位專業音樂人，koh有其他無仝專業ê台語家庭家長鬥陣參與，有職能治療師、有幼教專業人才、美術專長人才、媒體行銷專長人才、影像處理人才、台語老師等。逐家發揮家己ê專長，做伙負責樂團ê團務，m̄免過頭勉強做家己無內行ê khang-khuè，而且因為分工幼路，代誌mā ē-tàng處理kah koh-khah tsiâu-tio̍h。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">優點koh m̄-nā án-ne，樂團拄寫好ê囡仔歌，lóng ē隨分享hōo團隊--裡所有ê人，hōo in ē-tàng tī厝--裡放hōo囡仔聽，甚至koh ē提去「共學」ê現場，觀察囡仔對新作品ê反應；若發現無夠理想ê所在，就ē隨提tńg去調整。所以落尾thang留--落-來ê創作，百面是tsiânn受囡仔歡迎--ê，而且已經通過囡仔ê「考試」--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">身為台語路親子樂團ê團長，我感覺tsiânn幸運mā tsiânn幸福，因為ē-tàng有一陣人為著母語做伙拍拚，而且m̄免為著家己無內行ê事工leh煩惱。Khah早蔣渭水sia̋n-pái講過「同胞須團結，團結真有力」——tī tsit个樂團運作ê過程，我對眾人做伙拍拚ê力量，有影是感受tsiânn深。Ǹg望台語界，甚至lán所有台灣人，mā lóng ē-tàng大團結，因為團結有影是「真有力」！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是台語路親子樂團ê團長）</span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgUhasl-BMw_1RwCq8X9NIjIUBFQEiT7ue6YG3ZBW3tu5tCsU6h8eHegMSErtfccmIyaFL1kTtG8HklcvVmIOCMD-aCPQHftPrnLz3UIMkkYitJHCtaXVzSaiB3p8JnFLsYUG5X48eSfQ9niuJWMQiAn1SBXPsjA020afp3ujDNYju0K-PBQNE095QZQ/s1424/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgUhasl-BMw_1RwCq8X9NIjIUBFQEiT7ue6YG3ZBW3tu5tCsU6h8eHegMSErtfccmIyaFL1kTtG8HklcvVmIOCMD-aCPQHftPrnLz3UIMkkYitJHCtaXVzSaiB3p8JnFLsYUG5X48eSfQ9niuJWMQiAn1SBXPsjA020afp3ujDNYju0K-PBQNE095QZQ/w450-h640/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEja8XjEIU04WaR6bHLGKjcvwCpm30888_Y9Y0wYR0u4LKEWxdC_KlHahiyuWwJGTN0El1QUQr2izMx5rt02UIwaEIX-e_dV0rnB3qJrdl2tfz07xATYHnWXSZ0rMz09qcEGxdf1nazO2-h88BdlpH50aF2XeQO_wzbcQwemkhRuU1MNOqd0050Cdz4k0Q/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_032.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEja8XjEIU04WaR6bHLGKjcvwCpm30888_Y9Y0wYR0u4LKEWxdC_KlHahiyuWwJGTN0El1QUQr2izMx5rt02UIwaEIX-e_dV0rnB3qJrdl2tfz07xATYHnWXSZ0rMz09qcEGxdf1nazO2-h88BdlpH50aF2XeQO_wzbcQwemkhRuU1MNOqd0050Cdz4k0Q/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_032.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>台灣人寫真&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap<b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>台羅</span></b>。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: med